# Build context is the repo root, because the bundled QUL Resources in `data/`
# live outside `app/` and are statically imported by the data layer. Everything
# below is either regenerated in the image or has nothing to do with the build.
#
# `data/` is deliberately NOT ignored: without it `next build` cannot resolve
# the JSON imports in app/src/lib/spread.ts.

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Installed and built inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Agent and planning material, not part of the app.
.scratch
.claude
.agents
docs
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
skills-lock.json

# Docs and metadata that never affect the build output.
LICENSE
README.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Local noise.
**/.DS_Store
**/.env*
**/npm-debug.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*
**/*.pem
**/.vercel
